Depends: libgmp10 (>= 2:6.0), libc6 (>= 2.17), zlib1g (>= 1:1.2.11)
Description: The Quant programming language
 Quant is a statically-typed scripting language with a stack-based bytecode VM,
 a full type checker, generics, structs, error handling, and a Language Server
 Protocol server for IDE integration.
 .
 Installed components:
  - glados      -- compiler and runtime CLI
  - quant-lsp   -- LSP server (works with VS Code and any LSP client)
  - stdlib       -- standard library .qa files
